# Sprint 2 – Security & Monitoring

## Components
- Wazuh Manager, Indexer, Dashboard (Docker)
- Elastic Stack (Elasticsearch, Kibana)
- Filebeat for log shipping
- UFW firewall
- Fail2ban for SSH protection

## Validation
- Containers running successfully
- Wazuh agents connected
- Security alerts generated and visible
- Logs indexed in Elasticsearch

## Outcome
The platform successfully detects malicious activity and provides centralized
security monitoring and alerting.

